QA3 C3. A struct that embeds a pointer to a wrapper has the wrapper's Unwrap
promoted. The Candidate is (*W).Unwrap, called on the outer value: the load is
made on the W that the outer composite literal holds, found through the
literal's stores. The Wrap Chain names the outer type's Unwrap.
-- args --
a.go:@q
